<title>CHILE: Santander rates Chile's CAP market perform.</title>
<headline>Santander rates Chile's CAP market perform.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment said it has started coverage of Chilean steel-maker CAP with a market perform rating, citing an improvement in operating margins but cotinuing high financial expenses.</p>
<p>The brokerage expects CAP's net profits to fall to $19.9 million in 1996 from $28.1 million in 1995 due in part to higher interest repayments on company debt.</p>
<p>Net earnings are seen rising to $22.7 million in 1997 and $31.1 million in the following year.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
